SPY NETWORK - CONTACT PROTOCOL
Human intelligence is handled through cut-outs. No member holds another's contacts.

- Primary reconnaissance: Zetsu. White half infiltrates, black half coordinates.
  Zetsu clones seed themselves near target villages and report beast movements.
- Sasori maintained a deep-cover asset inside Sunagakure (Kazekage's aide) prior
  to his death; asset status now dormant, do not reactivate without Leader approval.
- Rain sensor grid (Konan) monitors all entry to the home village. No outsider passes.
- Couriers use coded rain-signals and dead-drop scrolls. Never speak organisation
  names aloud in the field. A leaked ring is a leaked plan.
